        "title_zh": "谁 + 做什么 + 什么",
        "estimated_minutes": 8,
        "objectives": [
          {
            "en": "Build sentences in the order subject – verb – object.",
            "zh": "能按“主语—动词—宾语”造句。"
          },
          {
            "en": "Talk about things you like, eat and drink.",
            "zh": "能说自己喜欢、吃和喝的东西。"
